{"error":{"root_cause":[{"type":"security_exception","reason":"missing or invalid API key in Authorization header. Send `Authorization: ApiKey <key>`. This server writes its admin key to /tmp/om-xerj-L779/server/admin.key on first start, so `export XERJ_API_KEY=\"$(cat /tmp/om-xerj-L779/server/admin.key)\"` (every xerj CLI reads that variable, `xerj autoindex` included) or pass `--api-key <key>`. To run with no authentication at all — local development only — restart the server with `--insecure`, which disables TLS *and* auth."}],"type":"security_exception","reason":"missing or invalid API key in Authorization header. Send `Authorization: ApiKey <key>`. This server writes its admin key to /tmp/om-xerj-L779/server/admin.key on first start, so `export XERJ_API_KEY=\"$(cat /tmp/om-xerj-L779/server/admin.key)\"` (every xerj CLI reads that variable, `xerj autoindex` included) or pass `--api-key <key>`. To run with no authentication at all — local development only — restart the server with `--insecure`, which disables TLS *and* auth."},"status":401}